@startuml UC-15 结束问诊
actor 医生
boundary "问诊订单接口" as ConsultationController
control "问诊订单服务" as ConsultationOrderAppService
entity "问诊订单仓储" as OrderRepository
entity "处方查询端口" as PrescriptionQueryPort
医生 -> ConsultationController : 提交结束问诊（无需处方标志、版本号）
ConsultationController -> ConsultationOrderAppService : 结束问诊(订单编号, 无需处方标志, 版本)
ConsultationOrderAppService -> OrderRepository : 查询医生本人订单
ConsultationOrderAppService -> PrescriptionQueryPort : 查询订单关联处方
alt 无处方且未明确无需处方
  ConsultationOrderAppService --> ConsultationController : 40001
else 条件满足
  ConsultationOrderAppService -> OrderRepository : 按版本更新为已完成
  ConsultationOrderAppService --> ConsultationController : 返回成功或版本冲突
end
@enduml
